<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1962373924"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1630040870"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="失恋ソング沢山聴いて 泣いてばかりの私はもう。"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="りりあ。"/><amll:meta key="album" value="失恋ソング沢山聴いて 泣いてばかりの私はもう。"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:46.902"><div begin="00:01.207" end="04:46.902"><p begin="00:01.207" end="00:11.642" itunes:key="L13761">潮風に溶けた面影は幻のままで今も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你随海风飘散的面容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi o ka ze ni to ke ta o mo ka ge wa</span></p><p begin="00:13.868" end="00:19.549" itunes:key="L13762">リアルで鮮明な思い出は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真实而鲜明的回忆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri a ru de se n me i na o mo i de wa</span></p><p begin="00:19.559" end="00:24.574" itunes:key="L13763">何度も何度も繰り返す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在脑海一次又一次翻涌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n do mo na n do mo ku ri ka e su</span></p><p begin="00:26.711" end="00:32.454" itunes:key="L13764">嘘でもいいからそばにいてよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便是谎言也好 陪在我身边吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u so de mo i i ka ra so ba ni i te yo</span></p><p begin="00:32.464" end="00:37.091" itunes:key="L13765">もっと近くで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与我更加靠近</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo 't to chi ka ku de</span></p><p begin="00:39.596" end="00:42.714" itunes:key="L13766">すぐ好きになって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样坠入爱河</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su gu su ki ni na 't te</span></p><p begin="00:42.724" end="00:45.711" itunes:key="L13767">時間だけが過ぎて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只剩时间流过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji ka n da ke ga su gi te</span></p><p begin="00:45.721" end="00:51.164" itunes:key="L13768">あぁ…戻りたいな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 真想回到过去啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a mo do ri ta i na</span></p><p begin="00:55.503" end="01:00.112" itunes:key="L13769">失恋ソング沢山聴いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听过无数失恋情歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi tsu re n so n gu ta ku sa n ki i te</span></p><p begin="01:01.966" end="01:08.041" itunes:key="L13770">泣いてばかりの私はもう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是泪流满面的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na i te ba ka ri no wa ta shi wa mo u</span></p><p begin="01:08.051" end="01:10.324" itunes:key="L13771">捨てたいから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要抛开一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su te ta i ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:11.197" end="01:13.995" itunes:key="L13772">強がらないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别再逞强</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo ga ra na i de</span></p><p begin="01:14.003" end="01:18.728" itunes:key="L13773">素直になってよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坦诚一些吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su na o ni na 't te yo</span></p><p begin="01:21.160" end="01:25.684" itunes:key="L13774">お願いあの日の私<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托了 那一天的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ne ga i a no hi no wa ta shi</span></p><p begin="01:27.530" end="01:31.660" itunes:key="L13775">あきらめないで傷付いても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使遍体鳞伤 也请不要放弃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ki ra me na i de ki zu tsu i te mo</span></p><p begin="01:32.295" end="01:37.064" itunes:key="L13776">どうかその手を離さないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托不要松开你的手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka so no te wo ha na sa na i de</span></p><p begin="01:37.074" end="01:39.071" itunes:key="L13777">離さないでよ。<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝不要松开</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na sa na i de yo</span></p><p begin="01:39.081" end="01:44.180" itunes:key="L13778">なんて遅いよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但或许 为时已晚了吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n te o so i yo ne</span></p><p begin="02:09.043" end="02:14.608" itunes:key="L13779">君と撮ったこの写真もまだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和你一起拍的照片</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to to 't ta ko no sha shi n mo ma da</span></p><p begin="02:14.753" end="02:19.703" itunes:key="L13780">消せないままで今も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">至今依然无法删除</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ke se na i ma ma de i ma mo</span></p><p begin="02:21.886" end="02:27.426" itunes:key="L13781">最後にくれたあの言葉が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你最后对我说的那些话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i go ni ku re ta a no ko to ba ga</span></p><p begin="02:27.436" end="02:32.452" itunes:key="L13782">何度も何度も繰り返す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在脑海一次又一次回荡</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n do mo na n do mo ku ri ka e su</span></p><p begin="02:34.766" end="02:40.347" itunes:key="L13783">嘘でもいいからそばにいてよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便是谎言也好 陪在我身边吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u so de mo i i ka ra so ba ni i te yo</span></p><p begin="02:40.357" end="02:45.069" itunes:key="L13784">なんて言えたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若真的说出来该多好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n te i e ta ra</span></p><p begin="02:47.620" end="02:50.668" itunes:key="L13785">どこに行っても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论去哪里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ni i 't te mo</span></p><p begin="02:50.678" end="02:54.477" itunes:key="L13786">君を思い出しちゃうの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会想起你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi wo o mo i da shi cha u no</span></p><p begin="02:55.172" end="02:59.210" itunes:key="L13787">もうやめたいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我快坚持不下去了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u ya me ta i yo</span></p><p begin="03:00.416" end="03:05.153" itunes:key="L13788">失恋ソング沢山聴いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听过无数失恋情歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi tsu re n so n gu ta ku sa n ki i te</span></p><p begin="03:06.678" end="03:12.959" itunes:key="L13789">泣いてばかりの私はまだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是泪流满面的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na i te ba ka ri no wa ta shi wa ma da</span></p><p begin="03:12.969" end="03:16.039" itunes:key="L13790">君から貰った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依然还戴着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ka ra mo ra 't ta pu re ze n to wo</span></p><p begin="03:16.049" end="03:18.506" itunes:key="L13791">プレゼントを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">小小礼物</span></p><p begin="03:19.386" end="03:23.439" itunes:key="L13792">飾ったままだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你送我的礼物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka za 't ta ma ma da yo</span></p><p begin="03:25.937" end="03:30.618" itunes:key="L13793">お願いあの日のきみ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托了 那一天的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ne ga i a no hi no ki mi</span></p><p begin="03:32.334" end="03:36.510" itunes:key="L13794">嘘のぬくもりでいいから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只需要谎言的温度就够了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u so no nu ku mo ri de i i ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:37.045" end="03:41.803" itunes:key="L13795">どうかその手を離さないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托不要松开你的手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka so no te wo ha na sa na i de</span></p><p begin="03:41.813" end="03:43.800" itunes:key="L13796">離さないでよ。<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝不要松开</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na sa na i de yo</span></p><p begin="03:43.810" end="03:48.955" itunes:key="L13797">なんて遅いよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但或许 为时已晚了吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n te o so i yo ne</span></p><p begin="03:50.639" end="03:56.698" itunes:key="L13798">叶わなかった恋ほど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">越是难以实现的恋情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na wa na ka 't ta ko i ho do</span></p><p begin="03:57.432" end="04:00.312" itunes:key="L13799">忘れられない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">越是难忘</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re ra re na i</span></p><p begin="04:00.794" end="04:03.306" itunes:key="L13800">もう会えない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们不会再见面了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u a e na i</span></p><p begin="04:03.316" end="04:04.775" itunes:key="L13801">なんて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别这么说</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n te i wa na i de yo</span></p><p begin="04:04.785" end="04:07.279" itunes:key="L13802">言わないでよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要说</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n te i wa na i de yo</span></p><p begin="04:07.289" end="04:14.820" itunes:key="L13803">傷つくとわかっていたくせに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你明知这会让我受伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu tsu ku to wa ka 't te i ta ku se ni</span></p><p begin="04:20.206" end="04:25.186" itunes:key="L13804">失恋ソング沢山聴いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听过无数失恋情歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi tsu re n so n gu ta ku sa n ki i te</span></p><p begin="04:26.726" end="04:32.807" itunes:key="L13805">泣いてばかりの私はもう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是泪流满面的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na i te ba ka ri no wa ta shi wa mo u</span></p><p begin="04:32.817" end="04:36.055" itunes:key="L13806">捨てたいから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要抛开一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su te ta i ka ra</span></p><p begin="04:36.065" end="04:38.415" itunes:key="L13807">忘れたいから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re ta i ka ra</span></p><p begin="04:38.430" end="04:40.145" itunes:key="L13808">もう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要就这样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u ki mi no ko to na n te</span></p><p begin="04:40.626" end="04:43.313" itunes:key="L13809">君のことなんて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">关于你的一切</span></p><p begin="04:43.855" end="04:46.902" itunes:key="L13810">忘れちゃうからね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忘掉你了哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re cha u ka ra ne</span></p></div></body></tt>